<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MacMenuBar.com (中文)</title><link>https://macmenubar.com</link><description>超过1500个Mac菜单栏应用的精选目录</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 13:35:59 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>WheelClick</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/wheelclick/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wheelclick.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="WheelClick" height="1111" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wheelclick.webp" width="1408"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WheelClick 为 macOS 带来中键点击支持，具备可定制的触控板和 Magic Mouse 手势、Windows 风格的自动滚动、适合 CAD 的拖动控制，以及按应用规则。它是 &lt;a href="https://github.com/artginzburg/MiddleClick" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;MiddleClick&lt;/a&gt; 的后续版本。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://wheelclick.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 13:35:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Findit</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/findit/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/findit.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Findit" height="753" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/findit.webp" width="450"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Findit 让你通过捕获屏幕上任意选定区域中的文本或图像，来搜索屏幕上的任何内容。它支持多种搜索引擎、内置 OCR、可自定义快捷键以及灵活的设置，帮助你更快地完成工作流程。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/findit-search-your-screen/id6774022961" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:12:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>基普雷索</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/keepresso/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/keepresso.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Keepresso" height="507" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/keepresso.webp" width="500"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;让您的Mac保持唤醒，通过智能触发器、定时会话、AI代理检测、合盖模式和无头Mac工具，为您在编程、游戏、会议、服务器和自动化方面提供精准控制。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://keepresso.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 14:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>合盖（保持唤醒）</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/clamshell-keep-awake/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/clamshell-keep-awake.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Clamshell (Keep Awake)" height="695" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/clamshell-keep-awake.webp" width="500"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clamshell 可在合上盖子时保持 MacBook 继续运行，调暗内置显示屏，让工作不中断。它能处理电源变化，并在重新打开盖子时恢复正常睡眠行为。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://clamshell.dev/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 08:46:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Pulsr</title><link>https://macmenubar.com/pulsr/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pulsr.webp"&gt;&lt;img alt="Pulsr" height="609" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://macmenubar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pulsr.webp" width="400"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pulsr让你的Mac的关键系统统计信息保持可见，同时用通俗的语言解释正在发生的事情。快速识别资源占用高的应用，将它们带到前台或退出，而所有监控都在本地完成。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://twoplus11.com/pulsr" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="blank"&gt;访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 17:26:32 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>